; Tile block descriptor set by script code $88
;
; +0 byte: block width in tiles. +1 byte: block height in tiles. +2 word: address of the width x height tile numbers
; (row by row), inside the room script. Read by #R$A0DF. Both bytes are 0 until the first $88 runs.
@label=BlockWidth
g$A116 DEFB $00
@label=BlockHeight
 $A117 DEFB $00
@label=BlockData
 $A118 DEFW $0000
